Name the path or paths of each inode number inside an ext2/3/4, erofs or f2fs image (inodes with no path print as none)

Usage: android-doctor ncheck [OPTIONS] <IMAGE> <INODES>...

Arguments:
  <IMAGE>      
  <INODES>...  

Options:
      --json      Print JSON instead of text
      --no-color  Never emit colour, even on a terminal (also honours the NO_COLOR environment variable)
  -h, --help      Print help
